{"name":"Purple Cream","hex":"#d7cbd7","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"purple","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A colour between red and blue; violet, though often closer to magenta.","Any non-spectral colour on the line of purples on a colour chromaticity diagram or a colour wheel between violet and red."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a purple hue.","Not predominantly red or blue, but having a mixture of Democrat and Republican support."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/purple"},{"term":"cream","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The butterfat or milkfat part of milk which rises to the top; this part when separated from the remainder.","The liquid separated from milk, possibly with certain other milk products added, and with at least eighteen percent of it milkfat."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Cream-coloured; having a yellowish white colour."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cream"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cream","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is a dairy product composed of the higher-fat layer skimmed from the top of milk before homogenization. The butterfat, which is less dense, rises to the top and is skimmed off, resulting in gravity cream. The industrial production of cream instead uses centrifugal separators to make separator cream. Cream is often sold in grades defined by their butterfat content. It contains high levels of saturated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f7/01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg/330px-01_Mmm..._Apple_Crisp_with_Whipped_Cream.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream","wikidata":"Q13228"},{"title":"Purple","blocks":[{"text":"Purple is a color similar in appearance to violet light. In the RYB color model historically used in the arts, purple is a secondary color created by combining red and blue pigments. In the CMYK color model used in modern printing, purple is made by combining magenta pigment with cyan pigment, black pigment, or both. In the RGB color model used in computer and television screens, purple is created by mixing red and blue light in order to create colors that appear similar to violet light. According to color theory, purple is considered a cool color."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f8/Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg/330px-Iris_sanguinea_cultivar%2C_Wakehurst_Place%2C_UK_-_Diliff.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Purple","wikidata":"Q3257809"},{"title":"Cream (colour)","blocks":[{"text":"Cream is the color of the cream produced by cattle grazing on natural pasture with plants rich in yellow carotenoid pigments, some of which are incorporated into the fresh milk. This gives a yellow tone to otherwise-white milk at higher fat concentrations. Cream is the pastel colour of yellow, much as pink is to red. By mixing yellow and white, cream can be produced."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ec/Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg/330px-Milk_heavy_cream_B.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream_(colour)","wikidata":"Q2730433"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Milk-bottle.jpg/500px-Milk-bottle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/01/Milk-bottle.jpg/500px-Milk-bottle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A bottle of unhomogenised milk, with the cream clearly visible, resting on top of the milk","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMilk-bottle.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Merry_christmas%21.jpg/500px-Merry_christmas%21.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Merry_christmas%21.jpg/500px-Merry_christmas%21.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Christmas cake covered with whipped cream","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMerry_christmas!.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Stewed_nectarines.JPG/500px-Stewed_nectarines.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Stewed_nectarines.JPG/1280px-Stewed_nectarines.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7b/Stewed_nectarines.JPG/500px-Stewed_nectarines.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Stewed nectarines and heavy cream","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStewed_nectarines.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Ghent_Altarpiece_D_-_Popes_-_Bishops.jpg/500px-Ghent_Altarpiece_D_-_Popes_-_Bishops.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Ghent_Altarpiece_D_-_Popes_-_Bishops.jpg/500px-Ghent_Altarpiece_D_-_Popes_-_Bishops.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGhent_Altarpiece_D_-_Popes_-_Bishops.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/M81.jpg/500px-M81.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8b/M81.jpg/500px-M81.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":